<https://purl.openfaster.org/xsdo/xsd-ontology.owl> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://purl.openfaster.org/xsdo/xsd-ontology.owl> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "An OWL vocabulary formalizing XML Schema (XSD) 1.1's own abstract Schema Component Model (element/attribute declarations, simple/complex type definitions, particles, model groups) as graph-expressible classes and properties. Domain-agnostic: no relationship to any specific schema, module, or the Institutional Ontology's own concepts -- see the `realizations` repo for that linking layer. Ordering (xs:sequence) is expressed via an explicit xsdo:particlePosition integer property rather than rdf:List, deliberately -- see this repo's README for why."@en .
<https://purl.openfaster.org/xsdo/xsd-ontology.owl> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/title> "XSD Ontology"@en .
<https://purl.openfaster.org/xsdo/xsd-ontology.owl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
